OL,3,GNEWSATraffic chaos in Perthshire
OL,4,Avillages after Google Maps glitch
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Google Maps glitch has caused chaos
OL,7,Fafter traffic was mistakenly diverted
OL,8,Ffrom the A9 to a single-track road
OL,9,Fbetween Dunkeld and Pitlochry.
OL,11,FThe issue - which was first noticed on
OL,12,FFriday - saw vehicles, including
OL,13,Fcampervans, leave the trunk road and
OL,14,Ftravel through the Perthshire villages
OL,15,Fof Ballinluig, Tulliemet and Guay.
OL,17,FOn Saturday Transport Scotland posted
OL,18,Fon X on that Google Maps was falsely
OL,19,Freporting the A9 as closed and was
OL,20,Frecommending an "inconvenient alternate
OL,21,Froute" when it remained open.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,425,420,260,160,0,100
