OL,3,GNEWSATraffic chaos in Perthshire
OL,4,Avillages after Google Maps glitch
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe problem now appears to be resolved
OL,7,Fbut local residents said the inaccurate
OL,8,Finformation left them worried and, in
OL,9,Fsome cases, unable to leave their
OL,10,Fhomes.
